{"dct_title_s":"Parcel Map Index, Cambridge, Massachusetts, FY 2013","dct_description_sm":["Abstract: This layer contains polygons that split the City of Cambridge into 286 city blocks. Each block boundary is associated with an Assessors map, and a group of parcels. Each individual parcel has a map and lot associated to it. The 'map' refers to one of these blocks, the 'lot' is the tax parcel within the block. This data is updated through January 1, 2012.","Purpose: Created for reference purposes for the Assessing Department to group contiguous or geographically grouped parcels bounded by street centerlines."],"dct_creator_sm":["Cambridge (Mass.). Geographic Information Systems"],"dct_publisher_sm":["Cambridge (Mass.). Geographic Information Systems"],"schema_provider_s":"Harvard","gbl_resourceClass_sm":["Datasets"],"gbl_resourceType_sm":["Polygon data"],"dct_subject_sm":["Tax assessment","Real property","Cambridge","Tax","Assessing","Parcels","Index"],"dcat_theme_sm":["Property"],"dct_temporal_sm":["2013"],"dct_issued_s":"2014","gbl_indexYear_im":[2013],"dct_spatial_sm":["Massachusetts","Cambridge"],"locn_geometry":"ENVELOPE(-71.160694,-71.063749,42.403893,42.352677)","dcat_bbox":"ENVELOPE(-71.160694,-71.063749,42.403893,42.352677)","dct_rights_sm":["Use constraints: None","Access constraints: Unrestricted Access Online","Data credit: City of Cambridge"],"dct_accessRights_s":"Public","dct_format_s":"Shapefile","dct_references_s":"{\"http://www.opengis.net/cat/csw/csdgm\":\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/harvard-library/harvard-geodata/main/fgdc/CAMBRIDGE14PARCELINDEXFY13.xml\",\"http://schema.org/downloadUrl\":\"https://mps.lib.harvard.edu/assets/file/hgl:CAMBRIDGE14PARCELINDEXFY13\",\"https://github.com/protomaps/PMTiles\":\"https://hgl.harvard.edu/data/public/CAMBRIDGE14PARCELINDEXFY13.pmtiles\"}","id":"harvard-cambridge14parcelindexfy13","gbl_mdModified_dt":"2014-03-31T00:00:00Z","gbl_mdVersion_s":"Aardvark","dct_language_sm":["eng"],"dct_identifier_sm":["http